"""Build /root/safety_audit_brief_final.hwpx from template + JSON.

This script:
- extracts the HWPX (zip)
- replaces {{placeholders}} across all XML files
- applies risk-tier mapping: High/Medium/Low -> "<Risk> (<KoreanNote>)"
- formats inspection date YYYY-MM-DD -> YYYY.MM.DD globally
- fills corrective actions in order (조치1..N)
- removes stale layout cache elements (hp:linesegarray / lineseg / lineSegArray variants)
- verifies no {{ or }} remain
- repacks to /root/safety_audit_brief_final.hwpx
